      <div class="pathway-grid">

        <a class="pathway export-path" href="/export" data-reveal><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447933601403-0c6688de566e?w=1300&q=85" alt="Coffee beans representing Ethiopian agricultural exports" loading="lazy"/><span class="image-shade"></span><div class="path-content"><span class="path-tag">01 / EXPORT FROM ETHIOPIA</span><h3>Bring Ethiopian products to global markets.</h3><p>Explore coffee, oilseeds, pulses, spices and other sourcing opportunities.</p><strong>Explore exports <span>↗</span></strong></div></a>

        <a class="pathway import-path" href="/import" data-reveal><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092160562-40aa08e78837?w=1300&q=85" alt="Industrial equipment representing import sourcing" loading="lazy"/><span class="image-shade"></span><div class="path-content"><span class="path-tag">02 / IMPORT INTO ETHIOPIA</span><h3>Source what your business needs.</h3><p>Discover international machinery, equipment and business supplies.</p><strong>Explore imports <span>↗</span></strong></div></a>

